# CyberEx Update Repository
# Official APK hosting for CyberEx Android Application

# Ignore OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Ignore IDE files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Ignore temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp
*.log

# Ignore checksum files (generated)
*.sha256
*.md5

# Keep APK files
!*.apk

# Keep documentation
!README.md
!LICENSE
!CHANGELOG.md
!SECURITY.md
